# Reference Projects

## 1. Auth

### Purpose

An authentication and authorization learning project focused on understanding modern authentication architecture.

### Areas of learning

- OAuth 2.0
- OpenID Connect
- JWT
- Sessions
- Identity providers
- Authentication callbacks
- Protected routes
- Authorization
- Token validation
- Security considerations

### Portfolio positioning

Present this project as an exploration of how authentication systems work internally and how different authentication mechanisms fit together.

Example description:

> A learning project focused on understanding and implementing modern authentication flows using OAuth 2.0, OpenID Connect, tokens, sessions, and protected routes.



